WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Brush: Adjust the brush size and paint a highlight on a separate layer.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Retouch: Choose the Healing brush, Alt-click a source, and blend a short stroke into the painting.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Mask: Add a layer mask and brush away part of the new highlight.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Color: Inspect the color picker and choose a project palette color for the brush.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Layers: Compare layer blending and use Undo on the actual document.
